r: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>1<br /><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">柯柏榮</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/10/e.html\" target=\"_blank\">順記持ê路草行--去——記苗栗雪桐步道</a></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">2<br /><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">吳義舜</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/10/blog-post_3.html\" target=\"_blank\">四色樹</a></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">4<br /><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">張芳莉<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/10/e_3.html\" target=\"_blank\">熱--人ê學校</a></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">4</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">台語sa攏有講座</span></b></h3><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">主講／江文瑜</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">記錄／戴如意</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/10/eeham.html\" target=\"_blank\">政府ê雙語國家政策對本土語言ê衝擊hām因應之道</a></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">6</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">台文通訊30歲</span></b></h3><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">陳育萱<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/10/aiekah.html\" target=\"_blank\">Ài復興母語，應該重視台灣本土意識ê覺醒kah建立</a></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">8</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">阿瑞--ā話仙</span></b></h3><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">藍春瑞<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/10/blog-post_66.html\" target=\"_blank\">甜粿</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>11</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">醫學台文</span></b></h3><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">羅九安<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/10/bat-tiohmaai-koh.html\" target=\"_blank\">是按怎bat tio̍h過武漢肺炎mā是建議ài koh注疫苗？</a></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>12</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Lán來講看māi</span></b></h3><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">孫博萮<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/10/ai-ai-tui.html\" target=\"_blank\">公部門ài實施語言平等教育，尤其ài tuì司法部門做起！</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>15</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Bóng講笑</span></b></h3><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">黃靜惠<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/10/kap.html\" target=\"_blank\">姊夫——「牛屎kap蛇精」笑詼輯（三）</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>17</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">文學káng「台」</span></b></h3><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">石牧民<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/10/e_59.html\" target=\"_blank\">台語ê條件</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>18</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">生活ê藝術</span></b></h3><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">王秀靖<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/10/blog-post_31.html\" target=\"_blank\">囚室日記</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>20<br /><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">張寶明<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/10/e_71.html\" target=\"_blank\">大自然ê洗禮</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>22</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">光景bóng uē</span></b></h3><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Koa Hoàn-jiû<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/10/blog-post_50.html\" target=\"_blank\">台南北門</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>23<br /><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">蔡玉媐<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/10/makataoe.html\" target=\"_blank\">平埔族夜祭～Makatao嘉臘埔公廨夜祭ê尪姨</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>24<br /><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">陳昭穎<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/10/4-e.html\" target=\"_blank\">4--月ê三角湧</a><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/10/4-e.html\" target=\"_blank\">\t</a>\n</span>25</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">台灣人寫真</span></b></h3><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">吳柏鴻<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/10/e_23.html\" target=\"_blank\">武漢肺炎疫情下ê生活</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>26<br /><br /></span></div><div class=\"separato